sign ghost warning~
This zone is meant for 50's and 50's only. I wouldn't recommend a group
smaller than 3 avatars, I wouldn't recommend a group smaller than 5 either.
Things are not as they seem, some of the things you will see cannot be
defeated in obvious ways.  There is no room for mistakes.  The prizes that lie
inside are great, but the risk is greater.  Also, the zone has very graphic
imagery that is not suitable for those of gentle mindsets or very visual
imaginations. If you are offended or uncomfortable with torture, hell, and
nasty things like that, do not go forward. You have your chance now to leave.
Beyond this room you are on your own.

I Also would like to credit the poem "Time Cycle of the Ageless" for the
inspiration of this area. While some liberties have been taken, a lot of
liberities actually, the characters, some of the imagery, and the name
are the intellectual property of Scott N Creley, used without his expressed
permission, so if you know him, dont tell, I dont want to be sued.
Hehehe.
Have fun.

Nameless.
~
